ADDITIONAL NOTICES AND REGULATORY DISCLAIMERS

1. Medical Device Disclaimer (MDR UE 2017/745 & FDA MDDS 21 CFR 880.6310):
This software is strictly a passive, secondary visualizer of continuous glucose
monitoring (CGM) telemetry for personal informational and educational purposes.
It is NOT a medical device, does NOT perform automated insulin dosing, does NOT
calculate bolus or medication recommendations, and MUST NOT be used as the
primary basis for clinical decision-making. Always verify readings with an
officially approved reader or capillary blood glucose meter.

